'''Godly Weapons''' are obtainable from [[boxes]], [[crafting]], [[gamepasses]], [[:Category:Events|events]], [[trading]], or [[codes]]. Godly weapons are one tier below [[Ancient Weapons]], and one tier above [[Legendary Weapons]]. There are currently 124 different Godly weapons in the game, 85 being [[knives]] and 39 being [[guns]]. Box Godlies usually have a 0.2% (1 in 500) chance of being unboxed from their respective box.

